				\begin{document}$$\sigma = \frac{3FL}{{2bd^{2} }},\;\varepsilon = \frac{6Dd}{{L^{2} }}$$\end{document} where  F  is the applied maximum load (N),  L  is the support span (mm),  b  is the specimen width (mm),  d  is the specimen thickness (mm), and  D  is the mid-span displacement (mm).

